  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">LUMUST collab phase out workplan 2010-2011</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lund University, Social Medicine and Global Health</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Utfasningen av LUMUST-projektet syftar till att f&#xf6;rs&#xe4;kra  uth&#xe5;lligheten p&#xe5; l&#xe4;ngre sikt vad g&#xe4;ller Mbarara universitets kapacitet att forts&#xe4;tta driva program f&#xf6;r att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra h&#xe4;lsan f&#xf6;r befolkningen i v&#xe4;stra Uganda. Medel anv&#xe4;nds till forskningsutbyte, MPH-programmet, l&#xe4;romedelsutveckling etc.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">he LUMUST phase out objective is to ensure overall sustainability of the institutional capacity of Mbarara University in regard to its role to contribute to the health status of the population in western Uganda. Funds will support research collaboration, MPH program,curriculum development, capacity development, peer project and HIV/AIDS policy with their integration within Mbarara university</narrative>
  </description>
